.FIRE WEATHER...
Issued at 446 AM PDT Fri Oct 9 2026

Stronger onshore winds will lead to elevated fire weather conditions
across the interior and higher terrain Friday. Cooling and
moistening trend kicks off Friday with the help of a deeper marine
layer and an increase in onshore flow. Moderate to excellent
recovery is expected Friday night. Cooler, windier, and more humid
conditions are expected over the weekend with light rain possible
early next week.

